.docs/plans/v1.4.0-waves.md:513:- **Files owned:** `source_asof` population code on `SourceAttribution`, freshness fallback chain in trust input prep, semantic-bound parser per §F (rejects parseable-but-implausible timestamps), backfill script, factor-count consistency assertion.
.docs/plans/v1.4.0-waves.md:515:- **Done when:** backfill populates `source_asof` for ≥95% of legacy claims with §F bounds applied; legacy items use `LegacyUnattributed` at conf 0.5; item-level confidence parity test green.
.docs/plans/v1.4.0-waves.md:544:- **Depends on:** W3-B (Provenance), W3-C (claim rows), W3-G (`source_asof`), W3-H (`temporal_scope`). All four must be merged.
